Package: frecipes
Type: Package
Title: Hydrogeology steps 
Version: 0.0.1
Author: Jonathan Kennel
Maintainer: Jonathan Kennel <jkennel@uoguelph.ca>
Description: This package is an implementation of some common steps of the
    `recipes` package using `R6` classes. It also provides some additional steps
    that may be useful for the geosciences and signal processing. Two goals of 
    this package are to provide a higher performance package (memory and 
    computation time), and as a learning experience. 
License: GPL-3
Encoding: UTF-8
LazyData: true
Depends:
    Bessel
Imports: 
    R6 (>= 2.3.0),
    Rcpp,
    RcppArmadillo,
    RcppThread,
    RcppEigen,
    earthtide,
    splines2,
    specialfunctions
LinkingTo: Rcpp, RcppArmadillo, RcppThread, RcppEigen, splines2, specialfunctions, BH
SystemRequirements: fftw3 (libfftw3-dev (deb), or fftw-devel (rpm)), C++17
RoxygenNote: 7.3.1
